# The corpus is compared byte for byte.
#
# Two rules in section 3.3 of .system_design/TEST_SUITE.md are measured in
# bytes: the per-tier size cap, and the golden outputs the Markdown-transform
# tests take from these fragments. A CRLF checkout changes both, so the corpus
# is LF in the working tree on every platform. tests/test_corpus_policy.py
# carries the matching rule, which is what notices a file that arrived before
# this attribute covered it.
tests/corpus/** text eol=lf
